{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-09_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-09","title":"Bad to the Bone","storyCode":"4-9","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"379869665a21f468a187f0e1568519e55af74b82dc60c908a6e6884334a6693e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What exactly did Jessica see...? Were you with her?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...It's better if you don't find out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It has nothing to do with our combat operations... so don't worry about it right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"How long are you going to keep hiding, Rhodes Island insects?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(...! Mephisto! Did he find us?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"(Don't make any noises. Not yet. It's just another one of his tricks.)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Aww, still don't feel like coming out?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't think I didn't see your reinforcements coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, whatever. I have something to show you. I'm sure you'll like it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Looking back now... We were originally planning to take over Chernobog from the very beginning..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"We waited for so, so long... and finally our time has come..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"The moment when we take our revenge against Ursus! Against those who persecuted us Infected!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"But, what about the fellows in this sub-city?"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_guard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"They ran away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"They had pretty quick reactions. Ran away before we had a chance to take action."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Disconnected themselves, and took off as quickly as they could--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"But where did they hope to escape to?"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Our comrades had long permeated every district, waiting for our opportunity."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"In the end, we caught up to them, and gave them the punishment they deserved."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"These cowards, these perpetrators; what were we to do with them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"It's simple - we would make an example of them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"A proclamation that all injustices against the Infected would be purged..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"...Yes, that is the symbol of the Reunion Movement..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Let them all turn into effigies of terror, one by one!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"You, set that nearby effigy on fire! Let there be light!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Yessir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Come, light up this entire city! Let Rhodes Island see what happens to all of these cowardly oppressors!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"(--Don't!)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"(Quickly cover Amiya's eyes)","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor...? !"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Don't look!","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"...","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... a burning hellscape of malevolence and madness..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, let go of me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...No, you must let me see it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"One day, I must hold him accountable for his actions. Besides, I used to..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"(Let go of her)","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Why... Why..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica, calm down."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"--That bastard!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...This is too atrocious..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The smell of burning flesh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"... ..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"How long to you intend to keep hiding, my dear rabbit of Chernobog?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw your little rabble sneaking around earlier, so I thought you might've been up to something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"But turns out, you're just here to enjoy the show... How boring."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like you brought an entire party with you?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you do all this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Without using some terror tactics, how else were we supposed to minimize the losses?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Make an example out of these ten percent..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"...and the other ninety percent fall into line."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"This, you see, can be considered the best way of saving lives."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Doctor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I am not the same person I was back then.."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Even though you might not remember..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... Back then, I was timid, fragile, and easily scared... I couldn't move forward without you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I might even look the same way right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But the difference is, I've now seen more than enough tragedies."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want to see something like this happen ever again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...But nothing will change unless I face reality!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"After all, I have to remind myself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't afford to retreat..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to continue to fight on!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["???","Mephisto"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Meteorite"]}]}
